# Only what the comparison reads goes to GitHub. ETABS's own model and analysis files (.EDB, .K_*,
# .Y*, .msh, ...) stay on the PC: one run of the large models is over a gigabyte, too much to push.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.etabs.json
!*.case.json
!*.log.txt
!*.etabs.png
!*.skyframe-speed.json
!*.skyframe-speed.log.txt
!_api_probe.txt
!*.py
!*.bat
# real projects (R1): each model's text export, which SkyFrame imports
!R1/*.$et
